#. translators: Link to general settings in the dashboard.
msgid "Controls the date format for date meta data.  <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/article/formatting-date-and-time/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Formatting Date and Time</a>. Leave empty to use the default value from your <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">WordPress Settings</a>"
msgstr "Steuert das Datumsformat der Datums-Metadaten.  <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/article/formatting-date-and-time/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Datum und Uhrzeit formatieren</a>. Leer lassen, um den Standardwert aus deinen <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">WordPress-Einstellungen</a> zu verwenden"

